  "description": "YAVZAW crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Nd4 O12,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1C (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.741-3.741 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.41-106.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Nd4(OCH2-t-Bu)12·4(C7H8).",
